Description: Update CEF's chrome_browser_frame_mac.patch for Chromium 142.0.7444.162
 CEF's chrome_browser_frame_mac.patch was designed for an earlier Chromium version
 and fails to apply on Chromium 142.0.7444.162 due to line number changes.
 .
 This patch updates CEF's patch file to match the current Chromium source layout:
 - ValidateUserInterfaceItem: Updated from line 194 to line 207
 - Added null-check compatibility (browser_view_ ? browser_view_->browser() : nullptr)
 - WillExecuteCommand: Updated line numbers for Chromium .162
 - ExecuteCommand: Updated line numbers for Chromium .162
 .
 The refactoring (adding static methods with Browser* parameter) remains the same,
 only line numbers and null-check patterns are updated for .162.
Author: Debian CEF Maintainers
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2025-11-15

